 >>[2026-04-02 00:00] observe — four custom requests were declared in a client type map without equivalent server evidence.
 >>[2026-04-02 00:00] decide — earlier planning treated declaration as a mandate and editor parity as a goal.
 >>[2026-07-20 15:20] revise — audit declaration, configuration, invocation, observation, and tests first; mounted-consumer behavior and failure evidence now precede implementation.
 >>[2026-07-20 19:26] revise — add a canonical custom-protocol registry before new requests; routing, advertisement, typing, invocation, observation, and testing are separate evidence states.
 >>[2026-07-20 19:27] decide — future topography and differential requests transport Seed-owned exact coordinates and verified plans; garden, pulse, and hydration methods remain unearned until read-only payloads prove useful.
 >>[2026-07-21] observe — seed form-geometry/pulse land; formContext proposed as next earned custom method after registry.
 >>[2026-07-21] decide — prefer implementing spw/formContext (with tests) over reopening phantom resonance/frequency unless a surface hard-requires them; do not type formContext in client until server handler exists.
 >>[2026-09-30 16:54] revise — hold the matrix and formContext. Declaration is still not a mandate. A method is earned when a retained cost sample and a language wire both exist; editor parity does not create either.
 >>[2026-10-12 14:28] revise — Resolved ?[formContext_min]: spw/formContext landed in a999a24f with a handler (handlers/form-context.ts), form-context.test.ts and a client type; its result carries coupling, mobility and conceptual rules plus label position, not ladder axes.
 >>[2026-10-12 14:28] revise — Resolved ?[root_authority]: 0a8adfe2 landed workspace-authority.ts and URI-first manifest v1 where a consumer root outranks a mounted workbench and initialization inside a mount re-anchors to the outer consumer.
 >>[2026-10-12 14:28] observe — The stdio switch handles 23 spw/* methods (7 direct, 16 through handleSpwProbe) but SpwCustomRequestMap types 14; the phantom resonance, operatorFrequency, phaseContext and registerSnapshot types are now handled server-side. No registry exists; a name grep finds test files naming only 8 of the 23.
 >>[2026-10-12 15:22] revise — Commits named per the convention in 90c58bbc: 1 landed, 5 planned, 0 dropped.
 >>[2026-10-13 11:59] revise — Corrections from the caches (hosts/lsp-surface.spw, checked against stdio-server.ts 336 to 400): 8 methods are answered directly and 15 through the probe handler, not 7 and 16; ?[earned_requests] lists referenceGraph as uncalled, but VS Code calls it (commands.ts 114), and formContext has a client type and no caller. Scorecard bugs 1 and 2 are still present and land here as keep_cache_layers and trace_setting_id. capability_matrix becomes the one host matrix the Neovim and IntelliJ audits fill.
 >>[2026-10-13 15:33] implement — Landed ac381ee7: cacheReflection keeps plane and every well-formed layer card, so the cache card can show the LSP plane present; the language client id is spw, so spw.trace.server is the setting the client reads.
}

