#>wonder_agents_plans_lspcustomrequestcompletions_w_1
?["How many of the 23 handled spw/* methods does a landed surface actually call, and how many reach a test through the stdio dispatch?"]{
  #:depth #!computational // lens: evidence states
  $^["contract_axes"]@here => %[methods.handled, methods.invoked, methods.tested]
